        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Parameters Choice of the Control Framework Used for Simulations</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: white;\n    color: #090909;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1155px;\n    margin: 4px auto 0;\n  }\n  .table-label {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 18px;\n  }\n  .table-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    letter-spacing: .35px;\n    font-variant: small-caps;\n    margin: 1px 0 18px;\n  }\n  table.parameters {\n    width: 1078px;\n    margin: 0 auto 56px;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 25px;\n  }\n  .parameters th, .parameters td {\n    border: 1px solid #444;\n    vertical-align: top;\n  }\n  .parameters th {\n    height: 26px;\n    padding: 0 8px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 24px;\n  }\n  .parameters td {\n    padding: 1px 13px 0;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .parameters .mpc { width: 413px; }\n  .parameters .robot { width: 412px; }\n  .parameters .passivity { width: 253px; }\n\n  .columns {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 570px 570px;\n    column-gap: 24px;\n  }\n  figure {\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .chart {\n    width: 100%;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .left-fig .chart { height: 389px; }\n  .right-fig .chart { height: 383px; }\n  svg {\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n  .caption {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    margin-top: 1px;\n  }\n  .caption .fig-no { margin-right: 11px; }\n  .caption i { font-style: italic; }\n  .bodytext {\n    margin-top: 56px;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    line-height: 27px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .right .bodytext { margin-top: 45px; }\n  p { margin: 0 0 0 0; }\n  .section {\n    font-size: 23px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 27px;\n    font-variant: small-caps;\n    letter-spacing: .2px;\n  }\n  .blue { color: #0000cf; }\n  .axis { stroke: #242424; stroke-width: 1.1; fill: none; }\n  .grid { stroke: #b8b8b8; stroke-width: .65; opacity: .7; }\n  .shade { fill: #d7d7d7; opacity: .65; }\n  .curve { stroke: #3c3c3c; stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }\n  .dash { stroke: #888; stroke-width: 1.3; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 6 5; }\n  .svgtxt { font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif; font-size: 16px; fill: #111; }\n  .smallsvg { font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif; font-size: 14px; fill: #111; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"table-label\">TABLE I</div>\n  <div class=\"table-title\">Parameters choice of the control framework used for simulations.</div>\n\n  <table class=\"parameters\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"mpc\">MPC</th>\n        <th class=\"robot\">Robot</th>\n        <th class=\"passivity\">Passivity filter</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>\n          \\( \\boldsymbol{x}_0=[0,0.6,\\frac{\\pi}{4},\\pi,-\\frac{1}{2},0,0,0] \\)<br>\n          \\( \\boldsymbol{w}_x=[1e6,1e6,1.5e6,0,0,0,1e{-}2,0.1] \\)<br>\n          \\( \\boldsymbol{w}_u=[1e{-}3,1e{-}3,1,1,1] \\)<br>\n          \\( \\boldsymbol{W}_x=\\operatorname{diag}\\{\\boldsymbol{w}_x\\},\\ \\boldsymbol{W}_y=\\operatorname{diag}\\{10\\boldsymbol{w}_x,\\boldsymbol{w}_u\\} \\)<br>\n          \\( \\nu_s=1e3\\ \\mathrm{Hz},\\ N=5 \\)\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          \\( \\boldsymbol{K}_d=\\operatorname{diag}\\{3e2,3e2,3e2,90,90,90\\} \\)<br>\n          \\( \\boldsymbol{D}_d=\\operatorname{diag}\\{50,50,50,15,15,15\\} \\)<br>\n          \\( \\boldsymbol{K}_n=I_{n_q} \\)<br>\n          \\( \\boldsymbol{D}_n=0.1I_{n_q} \\)<br>\n          \\( \\boldsymbol{q}_n=[0.85,1.50,1.57,-1.65,-1.50,1.57,2.50] \\)\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          \\( T_0=1e{-}2 \\)<br>\n          \\( z_0=\\sqrt{2T_0} \\)<br>\n          \\( T_c=1e{-}2 \\)<br>\n          \\( T_\\varepsilon=5e{-}4 \\)<br>\n          \\( \\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}=\\operatorname{diag}\\{50,50,0,0,0,0\\} \\)\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n    <div class=\"left\">\n      <figure class=\"left-fig\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder chart\" aria-label=\"[Chart: tank energy and tank activation parameter]\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 570 389\" role=\"img\">\n            <rect x=\"80\" y=\"17\" width=\"458\" height=\"119\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n            <rect class=\"shade\" x=\"198\" y=\"17\" width=\"38\" height=\"119\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"80\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"538\" y2=\"17\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"80\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"538\" y2=\"80\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"80\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"538\" y2=\"136\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"198\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"198\" y2=\"136\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"235\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"235\" y2=\"136\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"385\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"385\" y2=\"136\"/>\n            <path class=\"axis\" d=\"M80 17H538V136H80Z\"/>\n            <path class=\"curve\" d=\"M81 18 C103 16 124 17 135 28 C146 40 143 65 151 79 C158 88 183 87 198 91 L200 135 L234 135 L239 39 C242 31 250 29 259 28 L259 21 L275 18 L315 17 L345 18 C360 21 365 38 381 43 C395 48 407 54 417 55 C422 58 424 52 427 50 C431 47 431 34 433 26 L437 18 L457 17 L492 18\"/>\n            <path class=\"curve\" d=\"M492 18 L496 28 L499 19 L505 18\"/>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"56\" y=\"21\">10</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"65\" y=\"84\">5</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"82\" y=\"160\">0</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"81\" y=\"341\">0</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"229\" y=\"341\">5</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"380\" y=\"341\">10</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"528\" y=\"341\">15</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"82\" y=\"11\">×10⁻³</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" transform=\"rotate(-90 44 84)\" x=\"44\" y=\"84\" font-style=\"italic\">T</text>\n            <text class=\"smallsvg\" x=\"275\" y=\"166\">(a)</text>\n\n            <rect x=\"80\" y=\"201\" width=\"458\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n            <rect class=\"shade\" x=\"198\" y=\"201\" width=\"38\" height=\"120\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"80\" y1=\"201\" x2=\"538\" y2=\"201\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"80\" y1=\"261\" x2=\"538\" y2=\"261\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"80\" y1=\"321\" x2=\"538\" y2=\"321\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"198\" y1=\"201\" x2=\"198\" y2=\"321\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"235\" y1=\"201\" x2=\"235\" y2=\"321\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"385\" y1=\"201\" x2=\"385\" y2=\"321\"/>\n            <path class=\"axis\" d=\"M80 201H538V321H80Z\"/>\n            <path class=\"curve\" d=\"M80 201H200V321H234V201H538\"/>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"66\" y=\"207\">1</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"62\" y=\"267\">0.5</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"66\" y=\"325\">0</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" transform=\"rotate(-90 43 262)\" x=\"43\" y=\"262\">α</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"291\" y=\"365\" font-style=\"italic\">t</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"307\" y=\"365\">[s]</text>\n            <text class=\"smallsvg\" x=\"275\" y=\"394\">(b)</text>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <figcaption class=\"caption\"><span class=\"fig-no\">Fig. 9.</span> Time history of the tank energy <span class=\"blue\">(a)</span> and tank activation parameter <span class=\"blue\">(b)</span><br>during the <i>passive case</i> simulation.</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <div class=\"bodytext\">\n        <p>We report the results up to \\(t = 15\\ \\mathrm{s}\\) to analyze the system behavior during and after the occurrence of the unexpected interaction; the performance along the whole trajectory is shown in the video accompanying this paper. Results are shown in Figs. <span class=\"blue\">8</span> and <span class=\"blue\">9</span>. In all the plots, the time interval during which the external interaction occurs is highlighted with a shaded gray area. The obstacle, which hinders the motion, causes an increase of the tracking error (Fig. <span class=\"blue\">8a</span>), which consequently generates an increase of the pushing force (Fig. <span class=\"blue\">8b</span>). This causes a reduction of the tank energy (Fig. <span class=\"blue\">9a</span>) starting at time \\(t = 3.83\\ \\mathrm{s}\\) when the collision happens, until the lower bound is reached at time \\(t = 3.91\\ \\mathrm{s}\\). At this point, the tank deactivates changes in the manipulator velocity set-point generated by MPC via the activation parameter \\(\\alpha\\) (Fig. <span class=\"blue\">9b</span>),</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"right\">\n      <figure class=\"right-fig\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder chart\" aria-label=\"[Chart: object tracking error and predicted forces]\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 570 383\" role=\"img\">\n            <rect x=\"79\" y=\"3\" width=\"458\" height=\"118\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n            <rect class=\"shade\" x=\"196\" y=\"3\" width=\"37\" height=\"118\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"79\" y1=\"19\" x2=\"537\" y2=\"19\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"79\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"537\" y2=\"36\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"79\" y1=\"53\" x2=\"537\" y2=\"53\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"79\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"537\" y2=\"70\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"79\" y1=\"87\" x2=\"537\" y2=\"87\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"79\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"537\" y2=\"104\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"233\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"233\" y2=\"121\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"385\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"385\" y2=\"121\"/>\n            <path class=\"axis\" d=\"M79 3H537V121H79Z\"/>\n            <path class=\"curve\" d=\"M79 84 C113 84 135 80 160 81 L196 81 L230 62 L233 42 L241 80 C246 96 253 106 263 99 C274 89 279 83 294 82 C309 81 318 87 336 86 C351 85 368 82 381 84 C399 86 414 88 430 87 C444 85 456 83 469 86 C485 91 505 88 537 86\"/>\n            <path class=\"dash\" d=\"M79 84 L196 84 L233 82 L245 86 L300 91 L353 87 L406 91 L467 89 L537 86\"/>\n            <path d=\"M79 84 L196 84 L230 62 L233 42 L239 83 L250 108\" stroke=\"#aaa\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/>\n            <rect x=\"84\" y=\"7\" width=\"145\" height=\"23\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\".7\"/>\n            <line class=\"curve\" x1=\"91\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"18\"/>\n            <text class=\"smallsvg\" x=\"116\" y=\"22\">eₓ − eᵧ</text>\n            <line class=\"dash\" x1=\"179\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"201\" y2=\"18\"/>\n            <text class=\"smallsvg\" x=\"204\" y=\"22\">eθ</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"44\" y=\"19\">0.08</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"44\" y=\"37\">0.06</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"44\" y=\"55\">0.04</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"44\" y=\"72\">0.02</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"61\" y=\"89\">0</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"40\" y=\"106\">-0.02</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"40\" y=\"121\">-0.04</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" transform=\"rotate(-90 24 85)\" x=\"24\" y=\"85\">ε [m or rad]</text>\n            <text class=\"smallsvg\" x=\"275\" y=\"150\">(a)</text>\n\n            <rect x=\"79\" y=\"180\" width=\"458\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n            <rect class=\"shade\" x=\"196\" y=\"180\" width=\"37\" height=\"120\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"79\" y1=\"187\" x2=\"537\" y2=\"187\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"79\" y1=\"221\" x2=\"537\" y2=\"221\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"79\" y1=\"255\" x2=\"537\" y2=\"255\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"79\" y1=\"289\" x2=\"537\" y2=\"289\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"233\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"233\" y2=\"300\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid\" x1=\"385\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"385\" y2=\"300\"/>\n            <path class=\"axis\" d=\"M79 180H537V300H79Z\"/>\n            <path class=\"curve\" d=\"M79 293 C108 294 125 287 140 278 C151 271 161 272 175 272 L197 272 C206 260 220 227 233 180 C235 202 238 229 242 251 C249 270 261 274 275 272 C288 269 298 264 308 267 C319 272 324 277 333 274 C345 268 352 270 364 273 C380 275 390 269 404 271 C424 275 439 271 460 273 C482 276 511 274 537 276\"/>\n            <path class=\"dash\" d=\"M79 294 L196 294 L233 287 L241 298 L302 297 L343 294 L382 299 L423 297 L467 301 L510 299 L526 292 L537 293\"/>\n            <rect x=\"429\" y=\"185\" width=\"104\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\".7\"/>\n            <line class=\"curve\" x1=\"434\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"456\" y2=\"195\"/>\n            <text class=\"smallsvg\" x=\"458\" y=\"200\">fᵇ<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\">c</tspan></text>\n            <line class=\"dash\" x1=\"493\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"513\" y2=\"195\"/>\n            <text class=\"smallsvg\" x=\"515\" y=\"200\">fᵇ<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\">cy</tspan></text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"55\" y=\"191\">15</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"61\" y=\"225\">10</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"67\" y=\"259\">5</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"67\" y=\"294\">0</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"76\" y=\"321\">0</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"227\" y=\"321\">5</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"377\" y=\"321\">10</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"527\" y=\"321\">15</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" transform=\"rotate(-90 44 250)\" x=\"44\" y=\"250\">fᵇ<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\">c</tspan> [N]</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"291\" y=\"343\" font-style=\"italic\">t</text>\n            <text class=\"svgtxt\" x=\"307\" y=\"343\">[s]</text>\n            <text class=\"smallsvg\" x=\"275\" y=\"371\">(b)</text>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <figcaption class=\"caption\"><span class=\"fig-no\">Fig. 10.</span> Time history of the object tracking error <span class=\"blue\">(a)</span> and predicted forces <span class=\"blue\">(b)</span><br>during the <i>non-passive case</i> simulation.</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <div class=\"bodytext\">\n        <p>tracking error begins to increase (Fig. <span class=\"blue\">10a</span>) and the pushing force correspondingly rises in a potentially dangerous manner until the obstacle is removed (Fig. <span class=\"blue\">10b</span>). After the obstacle is removed, the tracking error returns to its nominal values.</p>\n        <p style=\"text-indent:24px;\">The sharp increase in force results from the controller’s attempt to reduce the growing tracking error. In the absence of a passivity filter, no mechanism prevents the controller from continuously increasing the pushing force. Such behavior is clearly undesirable, as physical interactions that hinder motion are not intended to be treated as disturbances to be rejected within the proposed framework. Therefore, integrating a passivity filter into non-prehensile pushing is essential to prevent unsafe system responses.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"section\">V. Experimental Evaluation</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
